    {
      "message": {
        "content": "{\n  \"chapter_id\": \"CH01\",\n  \"chapter_argument\": \"临床证据表明，肠道微生物群扰动（尤其是抗生素与质子泵抑制剂暴露）与实体瘤患者免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）生存期缩短存在稳健的时序依赖性负相关，其中 ICI 启动后 60 天内的暴露风险最高，且该效应在头颈部癌、肾细胞癌和乳腺癌中显著，而在肺癌和黑色素瘤中未达统计学显著；粪菌移植（FMT）与活体生物疗法（LBP）在早期临床试验中展现出概念验证潜力，但伴随显著的毒性信号，且当前领域缺乏 III 期 RCT 确证疗效与安全性。\",\n  \"units\": [\n    {\n      \"unit_id\": \"CH01_U01\",\n      \"focus\": \"抗生素暴露对 ICI 生存的负面影响高度依赖于给药时机，ICI 启动后 60 天内暴露导致死亡风险增加 27%，且在不同实体瘤间呈现显著异质性。\",\n      \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH01_U01_P01\",\n          \"point\": \"抗生素对 ICI 疗效的干扰并非全或无，而是存在关键的‘时间窗’效应，ICI 启动后早期暴露风险最高，且不同肿瘤类型敏感性差异显著。\",\n          \"development\": \"首先引用大样本队列数据确立 ICI 后 60 天内暴露与死亡风险增加的具体关联（HR 1.27），对比 ICI 前暴露无显著影响以强调时机特异性；其次展开肿瘤亚组分析，指出头颈癌、RCC 和乳腺癌的显著生存劣势，对比肺癌和黑色素瘤的统计学不显著结果，说明异质性；最后引入荟萃分析数据作为背景，确认该关联在更广泛人群中的普遍性，同时指出观察性设计的局限。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0575\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供 ICI 后 60 天内暴露的 HR 值（1.27）及具体肿瘤亚组（头颈癌、RCC、乳腺癌 vs. 肺癌、黑色素瘤）的敏感性差异数据。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0081\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"提供荟萃分析汇总数据（>41,000 名患者），确认抗生素暴露与较差 OS/PFS 的整体关联趋势，佐证单一队列发现的外部效度。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_id\": \"CH01_U02\",\n      \"focus\": \"质子泵抑制剂（PPIs）长期使用与 ICI 生存期缩短独立相关，多药联用进一步放大微生物扰动带来的治疗脆弱性。\",\n      \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH01_U02_P01\",\n          \"point\": \"PPI 使用是 ICI 生存期缩短的独立风险因素，其机制可能涉及胃酸降低导致的菌群易位，且长期暴露风险高于短期伴随使用。\",\n          \"development\": \"先量化 PPI 对 OS 和 PFS 的 pooled HR 值，确立统计学关联；接着阐述潜在生物学机制（胃酸降低、口腔菌易位），解释为何这种药物扰动会影响免疫疗效；最后提及多药联用背景，暗示临床评估需考虑整体用药负担而非单一药物。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0339\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供 PPI 使用与 OS/PFS 缩短的荟萃分析 HR 值（OS HR 1.31），确立独立相关性。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0585\",\n              \"role\": \"机制支持\",\n              \"use\": \"提供 PPI 通过降低胃酸促进条件致病菌过度代表的机制解释，并在 NSCLC 队列中关联较短的 PFS 和 OS。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_id\": \"CH01_U03\",\n      \"focus\": \"FMT 与活体生物制剂在 ICI 耐药或一线治疗中显示出概念验证级的客观缓解率提升，但伴随显著的免疫相关不良事件风险，且疗效高度依赖供体特征与治疗骨架。\",\n      \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH01_U03_P01\",\n          \"point\": \"早期干预性试验（FMT/LBP）显示出一线治疗中的高缓解率潜力，但在耐药人群中效果有限，且双药免疫骨架下毒性信号显著，提示患者选择与方案标准化的重要性。\",\n          \"development\": \"对比一线治疗试验（FMT-LUMINate, MIMic）的高 ORR 与耐药试验（MITRIC）的阴性结果，说明干预时机与人群选择的关键作用；重点分析 FMT-LUMINate 中黑色素瘤队列的高毒性（65% 3 级+irAEs）与 NSCLC 队列的安全性差异，揭示治疗骨架（双药 vs 单药）对安全性的影响；简述 LBP 初步数据作为非 FMT 干预的参照；总结当前试验均为小样本单臂，缺乏对照。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供 FMT-LUMINate 试验中 NSCLC 与黑色素瘤队列的 ORR 对比及显著的毒性差异数据（双药方案下 65% 3 级+irAEs）。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0577\",\n              \"role\": \"例证\",\n              \"use\": \"提供 MIMic 试验在一线黑色素瘤中的长期生存数据（中位 OS 52.8 个月）及安全性良好的证据。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n              \"role\": \"局限\",\n              \"use\": \"提供 MITRIC 试验在 ICI 耐药人群中的阴性结果（ORR 0%），说明 FMT 并非普遍适用于挽救治疗。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0607\",\n              \"role\": \"比较\",\n              \"use\": \"提供 LBP（CJRB-101）联合 ICI 的初步安全性与 ORR 数据，作为 FMT 之外的另一种微生物干预参照。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"table_tasks\": [\n        {\n          \"table_id\": \"CH01_U03_T01\",\n          \"purpose\": \"比较当前主要微生物组干预试验（FMT/LBP）的研究设计、人群特征、疗效终点与安全性信号。\",\n          \"columns\": [\n            \"试验名称\",\n            \"人群与线数（肿瘤类型/治疗线）\",\n            \"干预方案（微生物干预 + ICI 骨架）\",\n            \"疗效数据（ORR/PFS/OS）\",\n            \"安全性（≥3 级 irAEs/TRAEs）\"\n          ],\n          \"row_tasks\": [\n            {\n              \"content\": \"FMT-LUMINate 试验：NSCLC 一线单药 vs 黑色素瘤一线双药\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n                  \"role\": \"比较\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供该试验两个队列的具体 ORR（80% vs 75%）及毒性发生率差异（0% vs 65% 3 级+irAEs）。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"content\": \"MIMic 试验：晚期黑色素瘤一线\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0577\",\n                  \"role\": \"比较\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供该试验的 ORR（65%）及长期生存数据（中位 OS 52.8 个月）与安全性记录。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"content\": \"MITRIC 试验：ICI 进展实体瘤篮子\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0578\",\n                  \"role\": \"比较\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供该试验在耐药人群中的阴性疗效（ORR 0%）及中位 PFS/OS 数据。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            },\n            {\n              \"content\": \"CJRB-101 Phase I 试验：转移性 NSCLC 等\",\n              \"source_uses\": [\n                {\n                  \"source_handle\": \"P0607\",\n                  \"role\": \"比较\",\n                  \"use\": \"提供 LBP 干预的 ORR（58%）及无 DLT/无>3 级 TRAE 的安全性数据。\"\n                }\n              ]\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"unit_id\": \"CH01_U04\",\n      \"focus\": \"现有证据呈现明显的层级分化：大样本回顾性队列确立了微生物扰动的预后价值，而干预性数据仍停留在概念验证阶段，缺乏 III 期 RCT。\",\n      \"paragraph_tasks\": [\n        {\n          \"paragraph_id\": \"CH01_U04_P01\",\n          \"point\": \"当前临床证据等级存在断层：观察性关联稳健但无法确证因果，干预性试验多为小样本 I/II 期，缺乏确证性 III 期 RCT 支持常规临床应用。\",\n          \"development\": \"总结观察性数据（抗生素/PPI）与干预性数据（FMT/LBP）的证据等级差异；引用荟萃分析指出纳入试验多为 Phase I/II 且无大型 Phase III 报告主要终点；明确截至 2025 年底无完成 III 期试验证实生存获益；提出临床实践建议（谨慎管理抗生素，FMT/LBP 限于试验）及未来优先事项。\",\n          \"source_uses\": [\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0212\",\n              \"role\": \"主论据\",\n              \"use\": \"提供 FMT 联合 ICI 的荟萃分析数据（总体 ORR 43%），并明确指出纳入研究中无大型 Phase III RCT 报告主要疗效终点。\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"source_handle\": \"P0591\",\n              \"role\": \"背景\",\n              \"use\": \"确认截至 2025 年底尚无完成的 III 期随机试验证实微生物组干预在肿瘤学中的可重复生存获益，界定证据边界。\"\n            }\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unused_sources\": []\n}",
        "reasoning_content": "The user wants me to act as a **Chapter Editor** for a review article.\nMy task is to organize the writing tasks for Chapter 01 (\"Clinical Evidence Landscape: Antibiotic Timing, FMT Trials, and Observational Data\") based on the provided input.\nI need to:\n1.  **Allocate all selected sources** (`sources`) to specific paragraph tasks or table tasks.\n2.  **Organize case-level sources** into paragraphs or tables, ensuring they support specific claims rather than just listing them.\n3.  **Define paragraph tasks** with `point`, `development`, and `source_uses` (role + use).\n4.  **Reference existing paragraph tasks** if any (currently `existing_paragraph_tasks` is empty in the input, so I will create new ones using the convention `<unit_id>_P<01, 02...>`).\n5.  **Create tables** only if there is genuine comparative value.\n6.  **Ensure every source handle** from the input is either used in a task or listed in `unused_sources` with a specific reason.\n7.  **Output a single JSON object** following the specified schema.\n\n**Input Analysis:**\n- **Chapter ID:** CH01\n- **Units:** 4 units (CH01_U01 to CH01_U04).\n- **Sources:** P0081, P0212, P0339, P0575, P0577, P0578, P0583, P0585, P0591, P0607. (Total 10 sources).\n- **Existing Paragraph Tasks:** Empty list `[]`. I need to create new paragraph IDs.\n- **Case Level Uses:** Provided for each unit, mapping sources to units. I need to refine these into specific paragraph tasks.\n\n**Plan:**\n1.  **Unit 1 (Antibiotic Timing):**\n    -   Focus: Antibiotic timing (post-ICI <60 days) and tumor heterogeneity.\n    -   Sources: P0575 (Zhang et al., timing & tumor types), P0081 (Meta-analysis, general association).\n    -   Structure: One main paragraph establishing the timing effect and tumor heterogeneity.\n    -   Task: CH01_U01_P01.\n    -   Source Uses: P0575 (Main evidence for timing & subgroups), P0081 (Supporting evidence for general association/meta-context).\n\n2.  **Unit 2 (PPIs & Polypharmacy):**\n    -   Focus: PPI impact on survival, mechanism (acid suppression), and polypharmacy.\n    -   Sources: P0339 (Meta-analysis on PPI), P0585 (Mechanism/NSCLC specific).\n    -   Structure: One paragraph on PPI clinical impact and mechanism.\n    -   Task: CH01_U02_P01.\n    -   Source Uses: P0339 (Quantitative HRs), P0585 (Mechanistic explanation & specific cohort data).\n\n3.  **Unit 3 (FMT & LBP Trials):**\n    -   Focus: FMT/LBP efficacy (ORR) and safety (irAEs), comparing different trials (FMT-LUMINate, MIMic, MITRIC, CJRB-101).\n    -   Sources: P0583 (FMT-LUMINate, NSCLC vs Melanoma toxicity), P0577 (MIMic, Melanoma survival), P0578 (MITRIC, Negative result), P0607 (LBP CJRB-101).\n    -   Structure: This unit has multiple trials with different outcomes (positive, negative, safety signals). A **table** would be very useful here to compare Trial Name, Population, Intervention, ORR/Survival, and Safety.\n    -   Paragraph: CH01_U03_P01 (Narrative synthesis of the trials).\n    -   Table: CH01_U03_T01 (Comparison of Interventional Trials).\n    -   Source Uses: All 4 sources used in both paragraph and table (or split). Let's put them in the table for clear comparison and reference them in the paragraph for narrative flow.\n    -   Wait, the schema says `source_uses` in `paragraph_tasks` and `table_tasks`. I can use the same source in both if the role differs (e.g., \"narrative evidence\" vs \"table row data\"). But to avoid redundancy, I'll assign them primarily to the table for data comparison and the paragraph for synthesis. Actually, the instruction says \"Same paper can be used in different paragraphs, but purpose must be different\". Using in paragraph + table is usually okay if the table is data extraction and paragraph is interpretation. However, to keep it clean, I will ensure every source is covered.\n    -   Let's create one paragraph task that synthesizes the findings, and one table task that lists the trial specifics.\n    -   Sources: P0583, P0577, P0578, P0607.\n\n4.  **Unit 4 (Evidence Gaps & Future):**\n    -   Focus: Lack of Phase III RCTs, evidence hierarchy.\n    -   Sources: P0212 (Meta-analysis noting lack of Phase III), P0591 (Review stating no completed Phase III).\n    -   Structure: One paragraph on evidence hierarchy and future needs.\n    -   Task: CH01_U04_P01.\n    -   Source Uses: P0212 (Meta-analysis data on trial phases), P0591 (Confirmation of landscape).\n\n**Checklist:**\n-   All 10 sources must be assigned.\n    -   P0081 -> U01\n    -   P0575 -> U01\n    -   P0339 -> U02\n    -   P0585 -> U02\n    -   P0583 -> U03\n    -   P0577 -> U03\n    -   P0578 -> U03\n    -   P0607 -> U03\n    -   P0212 -> U04\n    -   P0591 -> U04\n-   No `existing_paragraph_tasks` to reference, so I create new IDs.\n-   Ensure `development` is specific.\n-   Ensure `unused_sources` is empty if all are used.\n\n**Refining Unit 3 Table:**\n-   Columns: Trial Name, Population (Tumor/Line), Intervention (FMT/LBP + ICI), Efficacy (ORR/PFS/OS), Safety (Grade 3+ irAEs).\n-   Rows: One per source (P0583, P0577, P0578, P0607).\n\n**Refining Unit 1 Paragraph:**\n-   Point: Antibiotic timing matters more than just exposure, with post-ICI window being critical.\n-   Development: Start with general association (P0081), then drill down into timing specificity (P0575), then tumor heterogeneity (P0575).\n\n**Refining Unit 2 Paragraph:**\n-   Point: PPIs independently correlate with worse outcomes, potentially via microbiome alteration.\n-   Development: Quantify risk (P0339), explain mechanism/context (P0585).\n\n**Refining Unit 4 Paragraph:**\n-   Point: Current evidence is observational or early-phase; Phase III RCTs are missing.\n-   Development: Summarize trial landscape (P0212), confirm gap (P0591).\n\n**Self-Correction on Source Usage:**\n-   Input `sources` list has `current_uses` which are all `kind=case`. I need to make sure I don't just copy-paste those but integrate them into the `source_uses` of the tasks I