them, but I should ensure my tasks don't claim to answer them definitively if the sources don't. The tasks reflect the \"Evidence Gap\" nature.\n\n**Formatting:**\n-   `paragraph_id`: New IDs since `existing_paragraph_tasks` is empty.\n-   `source_uses`: List of objects with `source_handle`, `role`, `use`.\n-   `table_tasks`: `columns`, `row_tasks`.\n\nLet's write the JSON.",
